sequenceDiagram
    title Checkout flow
    participant U as User
    participant A as Api
    participant D as Db
    U->>+A: POST /order
    alt in stock
        A->>D: reserve
        D-->>A: ok
    else sold out
        A-->>U: 409 Conflict
    end
    loop retry twice
        A->>D: charge
    end
    A-->>-U: 201 Created
